From c549af68949b96737e1abe20c59f5a3e0de2d4d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <9751141+denson9874@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:41:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Updater: name ExpressiveOS and link its group and downloads

ExpressiveOS is its own ROM: the updater called every build "Evolution X",
sent "Report issues" to Evolution X's wiki and opened evolution-x.org for
downloads and blocked updates. Name ExpressiveOS in all locales, link
the ExpressiveOS Telegram group and the device's SourceForge folder, and
export updates to "ExpressiveOS updates/". Also repair two Irish strings
whose escaped, duplicated markup showed raw tags and the value twice.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
